# Requiem of Sin (battlefield.requiem_of_sin#helper, Boneyard Gully): Party of four at the entry: main (Y letter), bob
# (Mithran letter), cat (no letter), dan (Y letter). cat is refused with a release only; the other three enter and get
# event 32001 on the win, cat gets nothing. Each finish changes nothing: the quest's 32001 (OtherAreas/RequiemOfSin.cs)
# completes it only when accepted with battlefieldWin set to the battlefield, and no char here has the quest accepted
# (the quest flows prove the completion).
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75
keyitem LetterFromShikareeY
bob: keyitem LetterFromTheMithranTrackers
dan: keyitem LetterFromShikareeY
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
trigger _081
update 32000 option=97
finish
bob: trigger _081
bob: update 32000 option=97
bob: finish
cat: trigger _081
cat: update 32000 option=97
cat: finish
dan: trigger _081
dan: update 32000 option=97
dan: finish
tick 2000
kill SHIKAREE_Z_ROS
kill SHIKAREE_Y_ROS_TWT
kill SHIKAREE_X_ROS_TWT
trigger Armoury_Crate+84
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
tick 11000
